---
// ArchitectureFlow.astro - Visual LLM Roundtrip Diagram
---

<section id="architecture" class="py-16 px-4 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyber-cyan/10 border border-cyber-cyan/30 text-cyber-cyan text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">
      ⚡ ZERO-LATENCY SECURITY GATEWAY
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">
      How the <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-neon to-cyber-cyan">Reversible LLM Roundtrip</span> Works
    </h2>
    <p class="text-cyber-muted text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Third-party AI providers never see your customers' confidential identities or cloud credentials. Real-time bi-directional token restoration in $O(N)$ time.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Flow Visualizer -->
  <div class="relative bg-cyber-card border border-cyber-border rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Grid Pipeline -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 items-center">
      
      <!-- Step 1: User / Input -->
      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border/70 rounded-xl p-5 text-center flex flex-col justify-between h-56 relative group hover:border-amber-400/60 transition">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-cyber-muted mb-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">STEP 01</span>
          <span>CLIENT APP</span>
        </div>
        <div class="my-auto">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-400/10 border border-amber-400/30 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mx-auto mb-3">
            👤
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Raw Sensitive Prompt</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-300/80 bg-amber-400/5 p-1.5 rounded border border-amber-400/20 truncate">
            "Refund 4532-8921-0023-1192"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-cyber-muted font-mono mt-2">
          Contains Credit Cards, DNI, Keys
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Connector 1 -->
      <div class="hidden lg:flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-cyber-neon font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="animate-pulse text-lg">➔</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-cyber-muted">&lt; 50 µs</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2: pii-veil Engine (Hero of the flow) -->
      <div class="bg-cyber-dark border-2 border-cyber-neon/80 rounded-2xl p-5 text-center flex flex-col justify-between h-64 relative shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(0,255,157,0.2)]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-cyber-neon mb-2">
          <span class="font-bold">STEP 02 & 04</span>
          <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyber-neon/20 text-[10px]">IN-PROCESS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="my-auto">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-cyber-neon/20 border border-cyber-neon flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-3">
            🛡️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-black text-white">pii-veil Engine</h3>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 my-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyber-neon/15 text-cyber-neon font-mono text-[11px] font-bold">
              ⚡ ~100 µs
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyber-cyan/15 text-cyber-cyan font-mono text-[11px] font-bold">
              RAM Vault
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-cyber-muted">
            Luhn Checksum • Aho-Corasick $O(N)$
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">
          Zero Egress • C/Rust/WASM
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Connector 2 -->
      <div class="hidden lg:flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-cyber-cyan font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="animate-pulse text-lg">➔</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-cyber-muted">Sanitized</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3: External LLM -->
      <div class="bg-black/60 border border-cyber-border/70 rounded-xl p-5 text-center flex flex-col justify-between h-56 relative group hover:border-cyber-purple/60 transition">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-cyber-muted mb-2">
          <span class="text-cyber-purple font-bold">STEP 03</span>
          <span>CLOUD AI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="my-auto">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyber-purple/10 border border-cyber-purple/30 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mx-auto mb-3">
            🤖
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">External LLM Provider</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyber-neon/80 bg-cyber-neon/5 p-1.5 rounded border border-cyber-neon/20 truncate">
            "Processed &lt;CREDIT_CARD_1&gt;"
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-cyber-muted font-mono mt-2">
          OpenAI • Anthropic • DeepSeek
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Reversibility Strip -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-cyber-border/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cyber-neon animate-ping"></div>
        <span class="text-slate-300">
          <strong class="text-white">Seamless Return Flow:</strong> When the AI responds, the <strong>Streaming Restorer</strong> swaps tokens back in real-time.
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-cyber-muted">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/50 border border-cyber-border text-slate-300">
          🔒 SOC2 & HIPAA Compliant
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-black/50 border border-cyber-border text-slate-300">
          Zero Data Retention
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
